  %% @mode architecture
  %% @subtitle Dev-only services that give LiteLLM a semantic cache and a pgvector knowledge store, with BGE-M3 embeddings from the remote GPU host
  %% @card cyan | Semantic cache | Opt-in per request with cache.use-cache | Hit when cosine similarity is at least 0.92, scoped per end user | Qdrant runs on tmpfs, so recreating it deletes every entry
  %% @card violet | Knowledge store | sme-knowledge lives in vector-postgres (1,024-dim HNSW) | Search goes through BerriAI's litellm-pgvector connector | Opt-in Xberg auto-indexing anonymizes chunks with Presidio first
  %% @card rose | Scope | Qdrant and the connector run only in the dev profile; only litellm-dev calls BGE-M3, over plain HTTP | Production lists no vector store and no semantic cache | Promote capabilities through the dev-to-prod register
